WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.856
The heart-rate scenario shows why quality work
requires judgment Minus

00:00:05.882 --> 00:00:11.464
one is clearly incompatible with a normal heart-rate
measurement A blank value is a

00:00:11.490 --> 00:00:17.651
completeness problem Two hundred is unusual but it
may be physiologically

00:00:17.665 --> 00:00:23.284
possible in some circumstances That means we
investigate rather

00:00:23.311 --> 00:00:29.036
than automatically delete it Quality rules help us
identify records

00:00:29.062 --> 00:00:33.065
that deserve attention They do not replace domain
reasoning
